    "sourceSequence": [
      "Heartbeat schedules the existing afterJob once per eligible factory-enabled beat. No scheduling change is proposed.",
      "deviceOnline obtains the existing guarded pool connection. The unit fence may acquire its BEGIN/SET plus a live credential FOR SHARE before the application transaction.",
      "The application runs BEGIN, reads the exact owner/device, checks enabled/online with the current protocol rule, scans current queued Factory attempts under FOR UPDATE OF r SKIP LOCKED, inserts deduplicated events for returned runs, and COMMITs.",
      "Only actual insertEvent rowCount=1 schedules wakeCoordinatorAfterCommit; failures ROLLBACK and always release the client."
    ],
